#[navbar]

#[section, $md:
    @../ (Documentation) / Errors, options and assertions

    # Errors, options and assertions

    Moth separates ordinary absence, recoverable failure and broken invariants.
    Many languages combine these cases through null values or exceptions, which
    hides part of a function's behaviour.

    Use options for absence, `Error!` returns for expected failure and `assert`
    only when continuing would violate an invariant.
]

